sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Al as Alert
    participant Eng as Responder
    participant Dash as Dashboards
    participant Host as Host and process
    participant Dep as Dependencies
    Al->>Eng: symptom, not cause
    Eng->>Dash: is it one instance or all of them?
    alt one instance
        Eng->>Host: that host — CPU, memory, disk, network
        Host-->>Eng: a saturated resource, or none
    else everything at once
        Eng->>Dep: what changed — deploy, config, traffic, a dependency?
        Dep-->>Eng: the correlated change
    end
    Eng->>Eng: form one hypothesis that explains every symptom
    Eng->>Host: run the cheapest test that could disprove it
    alt disproved
        Eng->>Eng: next hypothesis — do not fix what you have not proven
    else confirmed
        Eng->>Dep: mitigate first, root-cause after
    end
    Note over Eng: stop the bleeding, then understand it
